governance/review-reports/code-delguard/r1-fix-report.md:41:**D（major）diff 前綴設定打破解析**：`cmd_delguard_check` 的 git diff 加 `-c diff.noprefix=false -c diff.mnemonicPrefix=false`（緊接既有 `-c core.quotePath=off`）。
